+## Combined backend implementation checkpoint — draft, 2026-10-04
+
+The isolated backend candidate combines reviewed native session composition,
+released SDK skills/middleware, QMB environment/replay recovery and recorded
+spot read binding. It retains loopback paired CT-40 admission, current
+session/grant/instance checks and one operator-owned environment registry.
+Generic skills are knowledge; native tool policy remains separate. A bounded
+cancellation race correction rechecks cancellation after canonical validation
+without turning a timeout or missing terminal into cancellation proof.
+
+Operator/API setup, ownership, exact evidence and remaining gaps are in
+`_docwork/backend-integration-handoff-draft.md` and the single
+`_docwork/backend-integration-ledger-draft.md`. These are implementation drafts,
+not ratification or deployment authorization. Broad coverage and component
+gates remain red. CT47 authoring requires actual dispatched Agent/provider
+provenance; native provider auth and remote endurance remain unverified.
